@startuml Keyboard_MES_Deployment_Current
left to right direction

skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodeStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  RoundCorner 8
}
skinparam node {
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #92400E
  BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
}

title Keyboard Assembly MES - 当前本地联调部署图

node "访问端" as AccessSide #EEF2FF {
  rectangle "Web Browser\nhttp://localhost:5173" as Browser
  rectangle "WeChat DevTools / Mobile\nMini Program" as Mini
}

node "开发机服务" as DevMachine #ECFDF5 {
  rectangle "Vite Dev Server\nfrontend :5173" as Vite
  rectangle "Spring Boot Backend\nbackend :8088" as Backend
}

node "本地数据服务" as DataSide #FFF7ED {
  database "MySQL\nkeyboard_mes :3306" as MySQL
  rectangle "Redis\nSession :6379" as Redis
}

node "项目资料" as ProjectFiles #F8FAFC {
  rectangle "SQL Scripts\nschema.sql / mock_users.sql / demo_*.sql" as SqlScripts
  rectangle "Contracts & Docs\napi-contract.json / docs/*.md" as Docs
  rectangle "PPT Assets\ndocs/ppt/diagrams + docs/ppt/images" as PptAssets
}

Browser -right-> Vite : HTTP 5173
Vite -right-> Backend : /api 代理或 CORS
Mini -right-> Backend : wx.request 8088
Backend -right-> MySQL : JDBC
Backend -right-> Redis : Session
SqlScripts -up-> MySQL : 已有库可复用，不重复新建

note bottom of DevMachine
  backend 默认端口 8088；
  frontend 默认端口 5173；
  本地联调前确认 MySQL、Redis 已启动。
end note

note bottom of ProjectFiles
  PPT、UML、图片已集中到 docs/ppt。
  项目资料不再用多条跨图连线表达，避免图面交叉。
end note

@enduml